@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
participant "Phone" as P
participant "Partition leader" as L
participant "Followers" as F
P -> L : SEND {c-77} (first try)
L -> L : not in dedup, not in flight:\nseq = 1234, in_flight[c-77] = entry
L -> F : append entry 1234
P -> L : SEND {c-77} (retry, 300 ms later)
L -> L : in_flight[c-77] exists:\nattach to the same entry.\nNo second number
F --> L : majority has entry 1234
L -> L : commit; dedup row visible;\nremove from in_flight
L --> P : ACK {c-77, seq 1234}
L --> P : ACK {c-77, seq 1234}
note over P, F : <b>Without the in-flight check</b> both tries read "not in dedup", because the first\nhas not committed yet. They would get 1234 and 1235: a duplicate on every screen.\nThe dedup table protects against retries after commit; the in-flight map, before it.
@enduml
